  "description": "Vertical Slice Architecture plumbing for Auderz microservices: MediatR 12 behind an\n      Auderz-owned IDispatcher abstraction, a FluentValidation pipeline behaviour that validates\n      every request, self-registering endpoint slices, and mapping of asom.lib CommandResponse\n      types onto HTTP results.",
